      "ts": "2026-02-14T17:43:55.672-08:00",
      "player": "Qwen3L Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "SOLIDERS, WE HAVE A PROBLEM! This hand is LAAAAZY! Looks like you maggots decided to sleep in instead of showing up ready for battle! \n\
\n\
I see only one drop and it costs two colored AND a colorless? Where’s my curve? Where’s my pressure? I've got more useless Eldrazi nonsense than actual threats!\n\
\n\
You call this a hand? I've seen better strategy in a bowl of ramen!\n\
\n\
...But... it's not completely hopeless. We have two swamps, an on-color dual, and enough fixing to cast Push or Needle on turn one. Kozilek's Command gives us some late-game flexibility. We can probably stabilize.\n\
\n\
Mulligan? No. We KEEP this mess and make it WORK, you worthless pile of cardboard!\n\
\n\
