\n\
Naming **Wastes**? Useless.\n\
\n\
Naming **Kozilek’s Command**? Also useless.\n\
\n\
But we can name *anything* — including the unknown.\n\
\n\
Let’s play **Pithing Needle** — get it down now, while the coast is clear.\n\
\n\
And we’ll name… **\"Planeswalker\"**! That’s right — if Coach tries to drop any four-star officer, their abilities are **SHUT DOWN**!\n\
\n\
Now get out there, Needle — be the spike in the enemy’s tire!\n\
\n\
\n\
