      "player": "Qwen3L Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "You think I’m stupid, Coach?\n\
\n\
You drop an **Icetill Explorer** — 1/3 for {1}{G/U} — and think I’m gonna let it chip away at me?\n\
\n\
That thing has **deathtouch** — one hit from that, and my future creatures are **dead** before they hit the board.\n\
\n\
And you’re at 18 — you think you can afford damage?\n\
\n\
No, no, you overgrown scout — you’re going **six feet under**!\n\
\n\
**Fatal Push**, you’ve been waiting all game — **NOW YOU EARN YOUR PAY!**\n\
\n\
Cast it! Pay {B} — tap that **Swamp** we just got, you lazy rock!\n\
\n\
And **PUSH** that Explorer into the dirt where it belongs!\n\
\n\
Do it with *honor* — and *violence*!\n\
\n\
\n\
