      "player": "Qwen3L Sarge",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "BACK ON THE FIELD, YOU LAZY RECRUITS!\n\
\n\
Turn 3 — we’re bleeding life (17?! That’s disgraceful!) but we’ve got **options**!\n\
\n\
We haven’t drawn a creature yet — just lands, burn, utility, and that fancy spear.\n\
\n\
But we’ve got **two Eldrazi Temples** — play one now, keep one for flexibility.\n\
\n\
Do we play **Wastes**, **Swamp**, or **Temple**?\n\
\n\
We’ve already played a Wastes last turn — we need **colorless** for **Shadowspear** and **Temple** for early Eldrazi.\n\
\n\
But we’ve got **two Temples** — no need to hoard both.\n\
\n\
So **Eldrazi Temple** it is — down you go, temple! Produce for your commander!\n\
\n\
And **stop looking at me like I kicked your dog**!\n\
\n\
Now let’s see if we finally draw a creature or if this deck has completely mutinied!\n\
\n\
