\n\
So **Command** waits.\n\
\n\
**Pithing Needle**? We already have one in play — naming **Urza** — no need for redundancy.\n\
\n\
**Shadowspear**? **YES.**\n\
\n\
{1} to cast — we tap **Eldrazi Temple** and **Wastes**, no problem.\n\
\n\
And once it’s down, any 0/1 Eldrazi Scion gets **+1/+1 and deathtouch** — and we can make a Scion just by attacking.\n\
\n\
We’re **set up to swarm** — once we draw a creature.\n\
\n\
But we’ve got **no creature**.\n\
\n\
Still — **Shadowspear** is **threat enablement**. It’s **value**. It’s **dangerous**.\n\
\n\
And it costs **one mana**.\n\
\n\
So **CAST IT**, you fools!\n\
\n\
Get that metal on the battlefield — let them know the *real* horror is coming!\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
