\n\
Mycospawn? Icetill? That's two attackers — but not enough to drop us from 17 to 12!\n\
\n\
Unless... did they have **trample**? Or extra combat?\n\
\n\
No — doesn’t matter now. We’re in the mud. We’re bleeding.\n\
\n\
But we’re **not dead**.\n\
\n\
And **not defeated**.\n\
\n\
We’ve got **seven lands** in play — including **Urborg**, which we just drew. That turns all our Swamps into **Black mana sources** — powerful.\n\
\n\
But we didn’t play a land yet this turn — so **Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth**, you’re going **DOWN**, you ancient horror.\n\
\n\
You make every swamp in this field quake with power — and we’ve got Swamps.\n\
\n\
Play you now, and suddenly **every** land taps for {B} — enabling **Fatal Push**, **Command**, and future threats.\n\
\n\
And we’ve got **Shadowspear** — which can even tap for **{1}** to shut off hexproof/shroud.\n\
\n\
But first — **LAND**.\n\
\n\
Play **Urborg** — no hesitation.\n\
\n\
Let the **graveyard tremble**.\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
