- **Sowing Mycospawn (3/3)** — blocked by **Nethergoyf (2/3)**\n\
- **Icetill Explorer (2/4)** — unblocked\n\
- One **Eldrazi Spawn (0/1)** — unblocked\n\
\n\
Damage came through:\n\
- 2 from Icetill\n\
- 1 from Spawn\n\
- Total: **3 damage** — we're now at **9**, but game says **7**?\n\
\n\
Wait — something's wrong.\n\
\n\
We were at **12**, took **3**, should be **9**, but we're at **7**?\n\
\n\
Did they have trample? Mycospawn has trample, but attacking into Nethergoyf (2/3) — 3 damage, 2 blocked, so **1 trample**.\n\
\n\
Ah! Yes — **1 trample damage** from Mycospawn.\n\
\n\
Plus 2 from Icetill, 1 from Spawn — **4 total** — 12 to **8**?\n\
\n\
Still not 7.\n\
\n\
Did they activate Spawns? No.\n\
\n\
Unless... did we take damage earlier?\n\
\n\
No — stack must have resolved extra.\n\
\n\
Forget it. We're at **7** — bleeding, but **breathing**.\n\
\n\
We survived the wave.\n\
\n\
Now — **our turn**.\n\
\n\
