\n\
Hand:\n\
- **Kozilek’s Command**\n\
- **Pithing Needle**\n\
- **Eldrazi Temples**\n\
\n\
Can we attack?\n\
\n\
**Nethergoyf** survived — 2/3 — and they have **four** Spawns and two Talismans — can produce removal.\n\
\n\
But **Kozilek’s Command** is flexible — if we cast it, we can choose “draw two, discard two” — refuel.\n\
\n\
Or “destroy target permanent” — but no great targets.\n\
\n\
Or “target player mills 10” — that could end this.\n\
\n\
Coach has 17 life — not close — but if we mill 10, they’re on half library.\n\
\n\
And **Nethergoyf** grows with every card in graveyard.\n\
\n\
They’re already at 5+ cards — **Goyf is 7/8** already?\n\
\n\
Check graveyard.\n\
\n\
Wait — use **get_game_state** to review.\n\
\n\
